  psychometric validations, and methodological guidelines, all correctly excluded as they do not provide primary RCT    
  data.                                                                                                                 
  - **Included Studies:** Only studies 254 and 270 met all criteria: both are RCTs (one cluster-RCT) explicitly         
  testing psychological/coaching interventions for stress/resilience in medical students, measuring appropriate         
  primary outcomes (distress, anxiety, depression, well-being)."""                                                      
                                                                                                                        
